; ..\_01_BSW\Src\BswM\BswM.c	  4673  
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\BswM\BswM.c	  4674   MD_BSWM_0310:
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\BswM\BswM.c	  4675        Reason:     Only a valid address is needed, data is not accessed.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\BswM\BswM.c	  4676        Risk:       Access to invalid data.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\BswM\BswM.c	  4677        Prevention: Covered by code review and test.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\BswM\BswM.c	  4678  
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\BswM\BswM.c	  4679   MD_BSWM_2741:
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\BswM\BswM.c	  4680        Reason:     In certain cofigurations this statement results always in true.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\BswM\BswM.c	  4681        Risk:       No functional risk.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\BswM\BswM.c	  4682        Prevention: Covered by code review.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\BswM\BswM.c	  4683  
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\BswM\BswM.c	  4684   MD_BSWM_2982:
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\BswM\BswM.c	  4685        Reason:     The semaphore is locked at the beginning and released at the end of the main function. It can be interrupted by other functions.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\BswM\BswM.c	  4686        Risk:       No functional risk.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\BswM\BswM.c	  4687        Prevention: Covered by code review and comment in code.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\BswM\BswM.c	  4688  
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\BswM\BswM.c	  4689   MD_BSWM_3200:
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\BswM\BswM.c	  4690        Reason:     The returned value of an arbitrary user callout is not used, because it can be any configured
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\BswM\BswM.c	  4691                    string, and such return value can not be predicted during generation of the code. 
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\BswM\BswM.c	  4692        Risk:       Testability might become too complex.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\BswM\BswM.c	  4693        Prevention: Covered by code review.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\BswM\BswM.c	  4694  
